sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff
    participant Browser
    participant MVC as PatientController
    participant Svc as PatientService
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Staff->>Browser: Open Patient/Create
    Browser->>MVC: GET Create
    MVC-->>Browser: Empty CreatePatientViewModel form

    Staff->>Browser: Fill demographics and clinical history
    Browser->>MVC: POST Create (ValidateAntiForgeryToken)
    MVC->>MVC: Validate ModelState

    alt Validation failed
        MVC-->>Browser: Return form with errors
    else Validation passed
        MVC->>Svc: CreatePatient(model)
        Svc->>UoW: GetRepository Patient
        Svc->>UoW: Add Patient entity
        Svc->>UoW: Add PatientClinicalHistory if provided
        UoW->>DB: INSERT Patients
        UoW->>DB: INSERT PatientClinicalHistories
        DB-->>UoW: New Patient Id
        UoW-->>Svc: Success
        Svc-->>MVC: patientId
        MVC-->>Browser: Redirect to Patient/Details
        Browser-->>Staff: Patient details page
    end
